{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>You shall make, its base.</b> Like מכונות שלמה (the bases of Solomon), and the proof is מכונות שלמה. Now because it is written between the Tent of Meeting and the altar, as a sign that the altar is not adjacent to the entrance of the Tent, but near it, and it is in the middle, opposite the incense altar. And the basin was between the Tent and the altar, inclined to one of the sides, and Scripture did not mention it because according to reason the mind is not inclined to the basin being opposite the incense altar, which is opposite the place of atonement:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:21.841987746Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}